Assassin Move & User Commands

[A]irport   : Fly to other cities in search of Targets.
[C]reate    : Create a Base and/or JOIN a Company.
[E]nd Life  : End current life - good for NO MONEY.
[F]ight     : Assassinate or fight other user in current city.
[H]ints     : Ask citizens for Hints to Targets whereabouts.
[I]nventory : Lists User Stats, etc.
[M]ission   : Get a Target or Assignment, or list current.
[G]uild     : Check for next level advancments.
[P]rint     : If assassins are in current city, PRINT/list them.
[R]esurrect : Resurrect & Heal. Costs $100 for Resurrection.

Assassin Information Commands

[D]ox/HELP!          : Hints and Help files.
[B]est Assassins     : Top 15 Assassins!
[L]ist Killings      : List last 10 assassinations.
[U]ser Listing       : List all Assassins currently playing.       
[!]Quit              : Leave program.

Assassin Special Commands (Base City, Company City, or Visiting Only)

[S]hops    : Bank, Weapons & Armor Supplies, and Training.
